  "body": "### Describe the feature you'd like to request\n\nI'd love to be able to display all of my game servers and some data about each one on my dashboard. I think it'd be great if there was a generic game server widget powered by [Gamedig](https://github.com/gamedig/node-gamedig) which would display the game name, server name, map name (if applicable), and online status. It'd be nice if there were also toggles to display the player count, a list of player usernames, and the version number of the server.\n\nUsing Gamedig, Homarr could support much more than just Minecraft servers and display more data as well.\n\n### Additional information\n\nGamedig library: https://github.com/gamedig/node-gamedig\nThis library allows you to query over 300+ games.",
